----------------------+\n404: | `dao.stream.transit`, `dao.stream.cbor`, `.codec`   | Transport codecs                       | Codec track; untouched (§8.1).                           |\n405: +-----------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n406: | `dao.pretty` (`pretty.cljc:8-23`, `StringWriter`,   | Formatting a value to a string; the    | Internal, pure (a string result; no world contact).      |\n407: | `clojure.pprint`/`cljs.pprint`, a custom cljd       | one consumer is the REPL's display     | Dialect formatting semantics: the three implementations  |\n408: | printer)                                            | (`repl.cljc:355`, V)                   | may format differently; the text is display only, never  |\n409: |                                                     |                                        | persisted or hashed. Allowlisted in list 1 (§8). No      |\n410: |                                                     |                                        | slice.                                                   |\n411: +-----------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n412: \n413: ### 3.2 Resolved effect calls, corrected (V)\n414: \n415: `random-uuid`: **27 lines in `src/cljc`, 26 in the adopted closure**; the\n416: 27th is `dao/postgraphics/terminal.cljc:14`, out of scope (OQ1). The 26:\n417: `dao/stream/ringbuffer.cljc:27,185`; `memory_log.cljc:73`; `ws.cljc:122`;\n418: `remote.cljc:1249`; `remote_pair.cljc:180`; `remote_route.cljc:173`;\n419: `journal.cljc:296`; `dao/jing/content/step.cljc:132`; `dao/lease.cljc:594`;\n420: `dao/await.cljc:235,240`; `dao/space/store/fs.cljc:137,351`;\n421: `yin/vm/linker.cljc:1685`; `yin/vm/ucf/custody.cljc:46`;\n422: `yin/vm/ucf/holder/driver.cljc:1507`; `yin/vm/ffi/remote_serve.cljc:417,604,606`;\n423: `yin/vm/telemetry.cljc:112`; `yin/repl.cljc:667,668,733,918`;\n424: `yin/repl/dht.cljc:117`. Other sources: `rand` at `rpc.cljc:114-116`,\n425: `rand-int` at `jing/dht.cljc:373`; secure generators at\n426: `space/dht.cljc:142-151` and `sign.cljc:119-123`; `gensym` at three sites;\n427: clocks at `main.cljc:1242-1542` (driver) and `driver.clj:169,206` (JVM lane);\n428: ambient at `fs.cljc:92,136,271-273`, `repl.cljc:275-277`, `main.cljc`;\n429: printing at `main.cljc` (19) and `antlr/repl.cljc:71`; timers at\n430: `async.cljc:52-57`, `storage.cljc:224-227`, `main.cljc:1321,1343`. All are\n431: deferred-scope entries (§9) except the clocks and printing in `main.cljc`\n432: (driver). None is in an H0-H4 file.\n433: \n434: ### 3.3 Exempt dialect syntax\n435: \n436: Not host contact; the H0 gate exempts them by pattern: `catch` type arms;\n437: `^long`/`^bytes`/`^String` hints; protocol and interface names in `deftype`\n438: bodies and `print-method`; `exists?`; `js-obj`/`(Object.)` opaque sentinels;\n439: require arms whose only purpose is an alias.\n440: \n441: ## 4. The host-implementation contract\n442: \n443: ### 4.1 Stream implementations and their seams (external contact)\n444: \n445: Unchanged from the tree for sockets (V) and listed for completeness; the\n446: storage, entropy and parser rows are deferred (§9).\n447: \n448: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n449: | Implementation             | Portable core (V)                          | Seam value a host supplies                            | Status                      |\n450: +============================+============================================+=======================================================+=============================+\n451: | Ring buffer, memory log,   | `dao.stream.ringbuffer`, `.memory_log`,    | None. (They mint identities today, §3.2: deferred.)   | Existing                    |\n452: | remote channel, waitset,   | `.remote_channel`, `.waitset`, `.observe`, |                                                       |                             |\n453: | middleware, apply          | `.middleware`, `.apply`                    |                                                       |                             |\n454: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n455: | WebSocket                  | `dao.stream.ws`                            | `{:connect! :bind! :unbind!}` (`host.cljc:20-33`)     | Existing                    |\n456: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n457: | Datagram and UDP           | `dao.stream.datagram`, `.udp`              | `bind!` (`datagram.cljc:15-23`)                       | Existing                    |\n458: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n459: | Durable journal and the    | `dao.stream.journal` over `dao.jing.file`  | Deferred (§9.2)                                       | Deferred                    |\n460: | storage beneath it         | and `store.fs`                             |                                                       |                             |\n461: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n462: | Entropy                    | Deferred                                   | Deferred (§9.1)                                       | Deferred                    |\n463: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n464: | Parser stage               | `yang.python.antlr.*`                      | Deferred (§9.3)                                       | Deferred                    |\n465: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n466: | wasm import surface        | `dao.stream.wasm.md` §1                    | The seven imports                                     | Existing spec               |\n467: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\n468: \n469: Seam rule (`abi.md` §6-§7 as acceptance): a seam entry is implementation-\n470: private, called only by the stream implementation that owns it; it takes\n471: host arguments and returns or deposits plain data; it never invokes\n472: application code; it classifies host errors into data; what it cannot do it\n473: answers as a qualified unsupported outcome. A map of functions that portable\n474: application code calls to reach the world is a host service and is rejected\n475: (`abi.md:143-148`); none exists in H0-H4.\n476: \n477: ### 4.2 The primitive profile: exact manifest (P)\n478: \n479: `dao.host.*` (OQ2 adopted) is a namespace family whose files contain only\n480: reader-conditional entries and docstrings stating each entry's law, kind (P\n481: pure, M mutating per §2.4) and oracle. Table A is the profile (76 entries);\n482: table B the portable code replacing host libraries; table C the runtime\n483: prerequisites.\n484: \n485: **Table A: profile entries.**\n486: \n487: +--------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----+-------+\n488: | Namespace          | Entries (consolidated from, V)                                                                       | N   | Slice |\n