ber |\n| D2 | Low | H:950,977,1085-1086 | HD4, §10 and §14 still call H2's deletion gate a \"one-file grep\"/\"empty grep\" while the H2 cell (714-719) specifies the closure tool reading `ns` forms | Reword to match the reader-based gate |\n| D3 |"}]}}
